{% comment %}
  DEXYFIED Customer Feedback & Reviews Section
  Real community transparency with verified reviews
{% endcomment %}

<section style="padding: 3.5rem 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-main); background-color: var(--bg-surface);">
  <div class="dexy-container">
    <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: space-between; margin-bottom: 2.5rem; padding-bottom: 1rem; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-main);" class="section-header-row">
      <div>
        <span style="font-family: var(--font-tech); font-size: 0.6875rem; color: var(--accent-blue); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.1em; display: block; margin-bottom: 0.25rem; font-weight: 700;">
          COMMUNITY TRANSPARENCY // REAL FEEDBACK
        </span>
        <h2 style="font-family: var(--font-display); font-weight: 700; font-size: 1.875rem; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: -0.02em; color: var(--text-primary); margin: 0;">
          Customer Reviews
        </h2>
      </div>

      <a
        href="{{ routes.all_products_collection_url }}"
        style="font-family: var(--font-tech); font-size: 0.75rem; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--accent-blue); font-weight: 700; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.25rem; margin-top: 0.75rem;"
      >
        <span>EXPLORE HARDWARE & WRITE REVIEWS</span>
        <span>→</span>
      </a>
    </div>

    <!-- Review Cards Grid -->
    <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 1.5rem;" class="reviews-grid">
      <!-- Review 1 -->
      <div style="border: 1px solid var(--border-main); background: var(--bg-surface-subtle); padding: 1.5rem; border-radius: var(--radius-xs); box-shadow: var(--shadow-2xs); display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0.75rem;">
        <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between;">
          <span style="font-family: var(--font-display); font-weight: 700; font-size: 0.875rem; color: var(--text-primary);">
            Hamza Tariq (Lahore)
          </span>
          <div style="display: flex; color: var(--warning-color); font-size: 0.875rem;">
            ★★★★★
          </div>
        </div>
        <p style="font-family: var(--font-sans); font-size: 0.75rem; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.6; margin: 0;">
          "The laptop stand in silver has solid build quality. Dual-rail frame doesn't wobble at all while typing on a 15.6 inch Dell XPS. Cash on delivery arrived in 3 days."
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Review 2 -->
      <div style="border: 1px solid var(--border-main); background: var(--bg-surface-subtle); padding: 1.5rem; border-radius: var(--radius-xs); box-shadow: var(--shadow-2xs); display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0.75rem;">
        <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between;">
          <span style="font-family: var(--font-display); font-weight: 700; font-size: 0.875rem; color: var(--text-primary);">
            Zubair Ahmed (Karachi)
          </span>
          <div style="display: flex; color: var(--warning-color); font-size: 0.875rem;">
            ★★★★★
          </div>
        </div>
        <p style="font-family: var(--font-sans); font-size: 0.75rem; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.6; margin: 0;">
          "AirPods touch screen case is super convenient. You can see the battery percentage of both left and right buds directly on the case. Very satisfied with prompt delivery."
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Review 3 -->
      <div style="border: 1px solid var(--border-main); background: var(--bg-surface-subtle); padding: 1.5rem; border-radius: var(--radius-xs); box-shadow: var(--shadow-2xs); display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0.75rem;">
        <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between;">
          <span style="font-family: var(--font-display); font-weight: 700; font-size: 0.875rem; color: var(--text-primary);">
            Bilal Khan (Islamabad)
          </span>
          <div style="display: flex; color: var(--warning-color); font-size: 0.875rem;">
            ★★★★★
          </div>
        </div>
        <p style="font-family: var(--font-sans); font-size: 0.75rem; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.6; margin: 0;">
          "I9 Ultra Max watch display is massive and crisp. Bluetooth voice calls work seamlessly without lag. Accurate description and fast nationwide shipping."
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  @media (min-width: 768px) {
    .reviews-grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr) !important;
    }
  }
</style>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Customer Reviews",
  "settings": [],
  "presets": [
    {
      "name": "Customer Reviews Section"
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
